Hypothesis PEEK : PECSB.peek_spec L ar HI.
Hypothesis IGN : PECSB.ignore_spec L ar HI.
Hypothesis SRD : PECSB.src_read_spec L ar HI.
Hypothesis GL : PECSB.get_length_spec L ar HI P.
Hypothesis MKE : PECSB.make_ec_spec L ar HI.
Hypothesis CMI : PMBX.cone_mi_spec L ar HI.
Hypothesis SMI : PMBX.slow_mi_spec L ar HI.
Hypothesis CMS : PMBX.cone_ms_spec L ar HI.
Hypothesis SMS : PMBX.slow_ms_spec L ar HI.
